### ============================================================
# 农产品融资交易平台 - REST API 测试
# 使用方法: 使用 IntelliJ IDEA REST Client 或 VS Code REST Client 插件
# 执行前请确保后端服务已启动 (http://localhost:8080)
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
# 1. 用户认证模块
### ============================================================

### 1.1 用户注册 - 农户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "test_farmer",
  "password": "123456",
  "realName": "测试农户",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "role": "farmer"
}

### 1.2 用户注册 - 采购商
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "test_buyer",
  "password": "123456",
  "realName": "测试采购商",
  "phone": "13900139000",
  "role": "buyer"
}

### 1.3 用户登录 - 农户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "test_farmer",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "farmer"
}

### 1.4 用户登录 - 采购商
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "test_buyer",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "buyer"
}

### 1.5 用户登录 - 专家 (用于发布知识/回答问题)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "expert01",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "expert"
}

### 1.6 获取当前用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.7 修改用户信息
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "realName": "测试农户更新",
  "phone": "13800138999",
  "address": "北京市朝阳区农业园"
}

### 1.8 修改密码
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "654321"
}

