### ============================================================
# 6. 融资服务模块
### ============================================================

### 6.1 发布融资产品 (管理员)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/finance/product/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "春耕贷款",
  "description": "支持春耕生产的专项贷款产品",
  "maxAmount": 50,
  "interestRate": 4.35,
  "term": 12,
  "status": 1
}

### 6.2 获取融资产品列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/finance/product/list?page=1&pageSize=10

### 6.3 获取融资产品详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/finance/product/1

### 6.4 申请融资
POST http://localhost:8080/api/finance/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 10,
  "application": "购买种子和化肥",
  "item": "水稻",
  "area": 100,
  "repaymentPeriod": 12
}

### 6.5 获取我的融资申请列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/finance/apply/list?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6.6 获取银行审批列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/finance/apply/bank?page=1&pageSize=10

### 6.7 审批融资申请 (银行操作)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/finance/apply/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 2,
  "comment": "审批通过"
}

### 6.8 更新融资申请
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/finance/apply/update/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 15,
  "application": "扩大种植规模，需要更多资金",
  "item": "水稻",
  "area": 150,
  "repaymentPeriod": 18
}

### 6.9 提交融资意向
POST http://localhost:8080/api/finance/intention
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 20,
  "item": "小麦",
  "area": 200,
  "period": 24
}

### 6.10 获取匹配的融资意向
GET http://localhost:8080/api/finance/intention/match?minAmount=10&maxAmount=30&page=1&pageSize=10

